      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "**Cut:** concatenate full clips. No continuation-context trimming.\n\n**Crossfade:** automatic synchronized video/audio transition (6 frames / 0.25 s, shortened for small clips). Advanced → transition_frames: 0 = auto; positive = manual frames. Each seam shortens the result by this overlap.\n\nSelect two MMH3 files. Segment 3 is muted: select its file and enable it (Ctrl+M) if needed. Connect more packets using the growing segment inputs, in order."
      ]
